  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Imposing Mausoleum</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Communication Sphere</p>\n<p>You always gain the conversion bonus upon converting an NPC, rather than only the first time you do so each level (see Pathfinder Campaign Setting: Cohorts &amp; Companions for rules on religious conversion). The bonuses overlap their durations, and do not stack. If your chosen religion does not have a listed conversion bonus, choose a skill. Your conversion bonus is a +2 sacred or profane bonus to the chosen skill.<br>\n<strong>Designer Note:</strong> Consult your party as to whether this talent is appropriate and acceptable in your game.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc61\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
